mm 18 marks 25 years since the deadly  51-day standoff between the Branch  Davidian cult and the federal government  in Waco Texas  David Koresh was the charismatic leader  of the fringe religious group more than  80 people were killed over the course of  the siege including Koresh his followers  and federal agents for the first time a  retired UPS drivers revealing how he  unknowingly delivered weapons and  ammunition to the compound in the weeks  before the confrontation 48 hours Peter  Van Sant reveals the secrets from Waco  that haven't been told until now I've  kept my story secret for the last 25  years I didn't want to take this to my  grave this delivery man unwittingly  armed the cult I had been blamed what  happened out there  Waco was a tale of a religious fringe  group that decided to fight back against  the federal government their leader  David Koresh a self-proclaimed son of  God he was incredibly charismatic I  waited patiently on the Lord he was  spellbinding he was a God in the human  flesh they would do anything for this  man even unholy acts how many young  girls did he have sex with I'm thinking  at least him he was a Jesus Christ who  could drink and smoke and love guns and  rock and roll but he was going to bring  about the end of times they began buying  guns investigative journalist Lee  Hancock covered Koresh for more than two  decades she is a CBS News consultant my  mom made bulletproof vests Joanne Vega  moved into the compound with her parents  as a toddler they were getting shipments  from an arms dealer  the Davidian arms race turned more  ominous when larry was checking a box in  his truck and about six to eight grenade  fell out of it he told his wife Debra  somebody had to do something  Debra told the Sheriff's Department who  called the Federal Bureau of Alcohol  Tobacco and Firearms  the ATF we were all concerned about the  fact that there were children present  after two months of reconnaissance ATF  authorized arresting David Koresh and  confiscating any illegal weapons my mom  grabbed me off the bed there were people  lying on the floor that were dead  I took a flashbang and threw it in the  window when I get through the window  there's a man standing in the room with  an ak-47 and I shot him several times  seconds later  Buford like this agent was shot I'm not  gonna let him kill me in here Buford on  the hood of the vehicle was rescued by  fellow agents the FBI takes over after  51 days they began ramming the main  building the horror was unimaginable  there were people who killed one another  David Koresh actually had a bullet wound  into the center of his head Joann  Villegas parents died in the flames she  saved your life I think about that all  the time your mother saved you mm-hmm  when people see the names they're just  names I see faces I've never failed it  much in my life that I failed every day  it crosses my mind Peter Van Zandt joins  us now Peter millions of Americans  remember this siege what did  investigators learn about what was  happening inside the compound  there was a real horror show on the  inside they were restricted in terms of  the amount of food that they had Koresh  had decided that all of the women in the  compound were his and he began having  sex with girls as young as 14 years of  age it's believed he may have fathered  as many as 20 children with some of the  mothers being minors themselves so he  was he was  committing statutory rape on the inside  and you said that among the children who  died they were all his he allowed other  children to leave yeah it wasn't long  into the siege where he led about 21 of  these children leave but those inside  were his biological children that he  wanted to keep with them and tragically  that there may have been as many as two  dozen of them who perished in the fire  you see the pain on that UPS drivers  face that he has to live with this so  many years later we all remember those  images guy and he is a fantastic  individual who tells his story for the  first time on 48 hours fascinating we  will be watching Peter thank you so much  thank you and you can see Peters full  report the secrets of Waco tonight at  8:00 p.m. 7:00 central right here on CBS
 

